     "head": "If the unknown parent is Rr",
     "sup": true,
     "group": [
      "gam",
      "og",
      "op"
     ],
     "text": "Half of the gametes of an Rr parent carry r, so about half of the offspring are rr, with the recessive phenotype: about 1 : 1. One offspring with the recessive phenotype is enough to show that the parent is heterozygous."
