     "say": "Three kinds of gene, three ways to write their alleles: in each column two alleles, then genotypes. Iᴬ and Iᴮ are codominant; Iᵒ is recessive to both",
     "alt": "Three columns. The first: R, r, Rr. The second: I with a raised A, I with a raised B, I with raised A and I with raised B. The third: X with a raised B, X with a raised b, then X with a raised B and X with a raised b, and X with a raised b followed by Y."
